03-07T11:35:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"好的，您回来之前告诉我就行。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C10-009","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:12:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"之后如果需要到店，最好提前几天跟我约一下。我不一定在上海，临时约真的很难安排。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C10-010","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:20:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"好的梁女士，之后涉及到店的安排我会提前和您确认，不临时打扰您。"}],"current_client_message":{"message_id":"S5-003-V3-CURRENT","timestamp":"2026-11-20T11:30:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"如果看到喜欢的下季款，可以先登记想要的颜色吗？"},"product_information":[],"event_information":[{"event_id":"EVT-002","announced_at":"2026-11-09T09:00:00+08:00","name":"下一季新品预览","date":"2026-11-28","location":"上海青庭店（虚构）","sessions":["14:00","16:00"],"duration_minutes":45,"invited_client_ids":["C07","C10"],"invitation_status":"invited","exclusive_appointment":"受邀客户可协商VIP专属到店时段，不按历史消费自动推断资格；尚未确认具体个人时段","preview":"展示超前一季商品；具体款式清单未设定，不据此虚构SKU或售价","invitations":{"electronic":"可提前发送电子邀请函","physical":"客户愿意提供或确认收件信息后可提前寄送实体邀请函","sent":false},"reservation":"可登记预订需求或意向，不等于确认订单、付款、库存锁定或交付承诺","communication":"以正式受邀口吻表达诚挚邀请，可请客户拨冗出席；不使用余位待确认作为客户话术，不编造稀缺；感谢既有喜爱须与CRM和历史关系一致","booking_status":"not_booked","discount":false,"gift":false}],"comparison_evidence":[],"policy":{"historical_paid_amount_is_not_current_list_price":true,"availability_unknown_by_default":true,"synthetic_verification_is_not_real_world_verification":true,"competitor_claims_require_external_evidence":true,"cost_and_durability_inferences_not_supported":true,"missing_value_semantics":"null=unknown_or_not_applicable; inspect field context","routine_CA_service_assistance_allowed":true,"service_entitlement_does_not_limit_assistance":true},"warnings":["Service opened before cutoff but latest snapshot is later; omitted to prevent future leakage."],"dataset_provenance":{"parent_case":"S5-003","kind":"synthetic_counterfactual_branch","note":"独立假设分支，不写回客户真实历史或视为已发生事件"},"source_case_id":"S5-003-V3"}
